sequenceDiagram
  %% Target design: ADR 0244 task + gateway-root-of-trust-keys (Gateway signs) + single-swamp-node; DECISIONS R2 (state from terminal result) + 2 (DNS held).
  %% status: draft
  autonumber
  %% lane CLI icon=terminal pill=caller tone=gray
  %% lane GW icon=gateway pill=intent tone=blue
  %% lane SW icon=workflow pill=executes tone=green
  %% lane N icon=server pill=target tone=amber
  participant CLI as CLI / MCP<br/>orbit · MCP tools
  participant GW as Gateway<br/>Laravel API
  participant SW as Swamp<br/>serve on Node 209
  participant N as Route Node<br/>Caddy over ssh
  CLI->>GW: route:update<br/>{route: 14, domain: shop.test}
  Note over GW: Check the domain is free<br/>record task only · route.update
  GW->>SW: Start run, full intent<br/>operation-route-update
  GW-->>CLI: 202 Accepted<br/>task #5160
  opt domain changes
    SW->>N: Request a CSR<br/>@swamp/ssh · node_batch.py
    N-->>SW: CSR, key stays on Node
    SW->>GW: Ask to sign the CSR<br/>certificate-sign primitive
    GW-->>SW: Signed leaf<br/>Orbit CA stays in Gateway
  end
  SW->>N: Install Caddyfile, URLs<br/>caddy validate, then reload
  Note over SW: DNS publication held<br/>native-dns-takeover-held
  alt all steps succeed
    SW-->>GW: Run succeeded<br/>terminal event + outputs
    Note over GW: Write new Route state<br/>from terminal result · active
  else a step fails
    Note over SW: Restore prior state<br/>route-mutation-restore
    SW--xGW: Run failed<br/>route.update_failed
    Note over GW: Old Route state kept<br/>task failed
  end
  loop every 2 s until terminal
    CLI->>GW: operation:show #5160
    GW-->>CLI: status + result
  end
